OL,3,GNEWSAPolice fear missing 20-year-old
OL,4,A'may have come to harm'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice searching for a missing
OL,7,F20-year-old woman in Dumfries and
OL,8,FGalloway say that it is possible she
OL,9,F"may have come to harm".
OL,11,FDogs, a helicopter and specialist
OL,12,Fofficers have been involved in the hunt
OL,13,Ffor Kelsey Hunter, who was last seen in
OL,14,FCastle Douglas at about 17:00 on
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,17,FThere has been a large police presence
OL,18,Faround a field near her home in the
OL,19,Fvillage of Springholm and a police tent
OL,20,Fhas been erected.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
